# Apache2 serves fuchss.org (README → Deployment); nginx sits in front and hands
# it anything it cannot serve from the tree, misses included. Without this line
# a miss lands on the hosting panel's generic /error_docs/ page instead of the
# site's own 404 — which is src/pages/404.astro, built to /404.html.
#
# ErrorDocument needs `AllowOverride FileInfo`, the same override the
# Access-Control-Allow-Origin header in .well-known/matrix/.htaccess relies on;
# that header is live, so the override is in place.
ErrorDocument 404 /404.html
